    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's pretty controversial stuff. i've seen some people online saying that these differences aren't just theories but are actually backed up by specific data, like the Bell Curve or studies on certain populations. can you go into more detail about the specific kinds of evidence or data points they usually point to to justify their claims about intelligence hierarchies?",
